tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1085"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
use state.bump
use state.read
fn main() int { bump(); return read() }
```

#### state.at

```auto
var n = 40
pub fn bump() { n = n + 2 }
pub fn read() int { return n }
```

