## Case: diamond-initializer-order
id: "av.parity.1085.diamond-initializer-order"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1085"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
use left.result as left_result
use right.result as right_result
var both = left_result() + right_result()
fn main() int { return both + 38 }
```

#### left.at

```auto
use leaf.read
var n = read() + mark_b()
pub fn result() int { return n }
```

#### right.at

```auto
use leaf.read
var n = read() + mark_a() - 1
pub fn result() int { return n }
```

#### leaf.at

```auto
var n int = mark_a()
pub fn read() int { return n }
```

