## Case: same-module-name-in-two-packages
id: "av.parity.1085.same-module-name-in-two-packages"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1085"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
use one.values.bump as bump_one
use two.values.bump as bump_two
fn main() int { return bump_one() * 10 + bump_two() }
```

#### one/values.at

```auto
var n = 3
pub fn bump() int { n = n + 1; return n }
```

#### two/values.at

```auto
var n = 1
pub fn bump() int { n = n + 1; return n }
```

